Vin 1 0 DC 0 ; Define input voltage source, assumed DC for SPICE
C1 1 2 1u ; Capacitor C1 between Vin (node 1) and node 2, 1 microfarad
R1 2 0 1k ; Resistor R1 between node 2 and ground, 1 kilo-ohm
L1 2 3 1m ; Inductor L1 between node 2 and Vout (node 3), 1 millihenry
Vout 3 0 0 ; Define output node Vout
